<p data-help-key="admin.apps-inventory">Configured provider/application inventory. Registration and client credential management await their separately deferred owner.</p>
<% Object.entries(config.organizations || {}).filter(([role]) => /serviceprovider/i.test(role)).forEach(([role, provider]) => { %><section class="card" id="provider-<%= encodeURIComponent(role) %>"><h3 class="card-header"><%= provider.name || role %></h3><div class="card-body"><p>Role: <code><%= role %></code></p><p>Organization: <code><%= provider.id || 'not recorded' %></code></p><p>Client ID: <code><%= provider.clientId || 'not recorded' %></code></p><% (provider.redirectUris || []).forEach(uri => { %><p data-help-key="admin.protocol-identity">Registered callback: <code><%= uri %></code></p><% }) %><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="<%= basePath %>/admin/services?view=assignments&amp;providerRole=<%= encodeURIComponent(role) %>" data-help-key="services.list">Open provider assignments</a> <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="<%= shell.address(basePath, 'certificates', state.source) + '&owner=' + encodeURIComponent(provider.id || provider.clientId) %>" data-help-key="admin.certificates">View app in Certificates</a></div></section><% }) %>
<p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="<%= urls.spClient %>" data-help-key="common.nav-doctor">Open Doctor</a> <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="<%= basePath %>/admin/services?view=catalog" data-help-key="services.catalog">Service catalog</a></p>
<section class="card" data-doctor-connectivity><div class="card-body"><h3 data-help-key="admin.doctor-browser">Doctor &amp; SMART</h3>
<p>Saved Doctor application base: <code><%= config.publicBaseUrls.spClient %></code> · revision <%= config.runtime.revision || 0 %>. Live connectivity not checked. Registered callbacks above are exact saved values; a reachable link does not prove registration readiness. Registration readiness is not checked against PCM metadata until Preview.</p>
<p>Changing the browser address updates only existing Doctor callback registrations. Restart pending SMART tests after Apply. No source, Consent, grant, client scope or provider ownership changes.</p>
<form method="post" action="<%= basePath %>/admin/config/doctor-browser/preview">
<label for="doctor-browser-base" data-help-key="admin.doctor-browser">Proposed Doctor browser base</label>
<input class="form-control" type="url" required id="doctor-browser-base" name="doctorBase" value="<%= options.doctorPreview?.doctorBase || draft('/admin/config/doctor-browser/preview', 'doctorBase', draft('/admin/config/doctor-browser/apply', 'doctorBase', config.publicBaseUrls.spClient)) %>" data-help-key="admin.doctor-browser" aria-describedby="doctor-base-consequence">
<p id="doctor-base-consequence">Enter the explicit HTTP(S) application base including its mount. Request Host/forwarded headers never register callbacks. Preview does not authenticate, discover dependents or save configuration.</p>
<button class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-help-key="admin.doctor-browser">Preview Doctor callbacks</button></form>
<% if (options.doctorResult) { %><p role="status"><%= options.doctorResult.status %> · saved revision <%= options.doctorResult.revision %>. <%= options.doctorResult.restartPendingTests ? 'Restart pending SMART tests. Prior config and Organizations were backed up privately.' : 'No registration changed.' %> Live connectivity not checked.</p><% } %>
<% const review = options.doctorPreview; if (review) { %><section aria-label="Doctor callback review"><h4>Proposed registration changes</h4><p>Saved base: <code><%= review.previousBase %></code></p><p>Proposed base: <code><%= review.doctorBase %></code></p>
<% review.registrations.forEach(registration => { %><article class="card"><div class="card-body"><h4><%= registration.role %></h4><p>Organization: <code><%= registration.organizationId %></code> · version <%= registration.version %></p><p>Client: <code><%= registration.clientId %></code></p><p>Registration review: existing provider ownership verified. <%= registration.metadataMatches ? 'PCM redirect metadata already matches the proposed callback.' : 'PCM redirect metadata will change to the proposed callback.' %> Live connectivity not checked.</p><p>Before:</p><ul><% registration.previous.forEach(uri => { %><li><code><%= uri %></code></li><% }); %></ul><p>After:</p><ul><% registration.next.forEach(uri => { %><li><code><%= uri %></code></li><% }); %></ul></div></article><% }); %>
<p><%= review.outstandingTransactions %> Review expires when config or an affected registration changes. Preview is not a live connectivity check.</p>
<form method="post" action="<%= basePath %>/admin/config/doctor-browser/apply"><input type="hidden" name="doctorBase" value="<%= review.doctorBase %>"><input type="hidden" name="reviewDigest" value="<%= review.reviewDigest %>"><button class="btn btn-primary" data-help-key="admin.doctor-browser">Apply reviewed Doctor callbacks</button></form></section><% } %>
</div></section>
